        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-211445-211457">苦節は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211457-211472"><rb>貞</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211472-211478">くす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211478-211490"><rb>可</rb><rt>べ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211490-211511">からずの一句、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211511-211526"><rb>易</rb><rt>えき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211526-211529">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211529-211550"><rb>爻辞</rb><rt>こうじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211550-211559">の節の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211559-211586"><rb>上六</rb><rt>しょうりく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211586-211601">に、苦節、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211601-211616"><rb>貞</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211616-211652">くすれば凶なり、とあるに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211652-211667"><rb>本</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211667-211676">づくと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211676-211694"><rb>雖</rb><rt>いえど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211694-211721">も、口気おのずから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211721-211736"><rb>是</rb><rt>これ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211736-211763">道衍の一家言なり。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211763-211778"><rb>況</rb><rt>いわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211778-211790">んや易の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211790-211817"><rb>貞凶</rb><rt>ていきょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211817-211829">の貞は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211829-211850"><rb>貞固</rb><rt>ていこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211850-211877">の貞にあらずして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211877-211943"><rb><seg source="#source-211877-211880">貞</seg><g ref="#gaiji-U-209E9-345-6" source="#source-211880-211925">𠧩</g>