        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-218312-218336"><rb>耿々</rb><rt>こうこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-218336-218351">たるもの　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-218351-218366"><rb>吾</rb><rt>わが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-218366-218383">胸に存す。</seg></p>
