      <div type="layout" source="#source-223917-226794" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-223952-223976"><rb>乾坤</rb><rt>けんこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-223976-224002">　果して何物ぞ、</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-224002-224026"><rb>開闔</rb><rt>かいこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-224026-224029">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-224029-224050"><rb>古</rb><rt>いにしえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-224050-224067">より有り。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-224067-224073">世を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-224073-224088"><rb>挙</rb><rt>こぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-224088-224097">って　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-224097-224112"><rb>孰</rb><rt>たれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-224112-224115">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-224115-224130"><rb>客</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-224130-224133">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-224133-224148"><rb>非</rb><rt>あら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-224148-224162">ざらん、</seg></p>
